# Getting started with the Futran Audit Platform

Welcome, {{ contacts.caico.name }}. This guide covers the first two weeks of {{ client.name }}'s {{ engagement.name | lower }}.

## Week 1

1. **Sign the engagement letter.** Read the scope and laws in scope, then sign in the platform.
2. **Confirm your role holders.** Nominate an Executive Sponsor and a Data Protection Officer, or mark them as not appointed.
3. **Set up departments and users.** Your Client Admin uploads the department list and the user list (CSV templates are in your package), or adds people one by one. Each department in scope needs a Department Compliance Lead.
4. **Circulate the employee data notice.** You will be asked to confirm you have reviewed it before the attestation can start.

## Week 2

5. **Answer the AI governance structure request.** For each document and role, upload it, name the people, or tell us when you will put it in place.
6. **Launch the employee attestation.** Copy the link into an email to the departments in scope. You can see responses come in by department.
7. **Build the AI inventory.** Contributors and Department Compliance Leads add each use of AI and the tools it relies on. The platform proposes a risk tier as you go.

## Good to know

- Everything you upload is visible only to {{ client.name }} and the assigned Futran team.
- Nothing is sent as an email attachment. Documents open after you sign in.
